---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AdRow from '../components/AdRow.astro';
const url = Astro.url.toString();
const headline = 'Why cybersecurity is a family issue, not just an IT issue';
const enc = encodeURIComponent;
const share = {
  fb: `https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=${enc(url)}`,
  x: `https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=${enc(url)}&text=${enc(headline)}`,
  wa: `https://wa.me/?text=${enc(headline + ' ' + url)}`,
  sms: `sms:?&body=${enc(headline + ' ' + url)}`,
  mail: `mailto:?subject=${enc(headline)}&body=${enc(url)}`,
};
---
<Layout title="Sample explainer" current="">
  <article class="art">
    <p class="art-sample">Design preview with sample text. Not a real article.</p>
    <div class="art-kicker"><a href="/news">Why It Matters</a><span>Technology</span></div>
    <h2 class="art-h">{headline}</h2>
    <p class="art-dek">One reused password can lead to a drained account, a locked-out phone and a very bad week. Here is what is actually happening and what to do about it.</p>
    <div class="art-by">
      <img class="art-av" src="/authors/caleb.jpg" alt="Illustration of Caleb" width="40" height="40" />
      <span><b>By Caleb</b><small>Local Buzz ATX · Nov 11, 2026 · 4 min read</small></span>
    </div>
    <div class="art-share" data-share>
      <span class="art-sharek">Share</span>
      <button type="button" class="art-sbtn" data-native>Share…</button>
      <a href={share.sms}>Text</a><a href={share.wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a><a href={share.fb} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a><a href={share.x} target="_blank" rel="noopener">X</a><a href={share.mail}>Email</a>
      <button type="button" class="art-sbtn" data-copy>Copy link</button>
    </div>
    <div class="art-why"><div class="lplabel">Why should I care?</div><p>Identity theft hits working families hardest, and it can take months to untangle. Most of it starts with something small.</p></div>
    <div class="art-body">
      <h3>What's really going on</h3>
      <p>Most people picture a hacker as someone breaking into a company. Much of the time it is quieter than that. A password leaks from one site, and the same password gets tried on email, banking and shopping accounts.</p>
      <p>That is why this is a family issue. Kids share devices, parents reuse passwords, and one weak spot opens the rest.</p>
      <blockquote>You do not need to be an expert. You need a few habits you can keep.</blockquote>
      <h3>What you can do this week</h3>
      <ul class="art-list">
        <li><b>Use a password manager.</b> One strong password to remember, and unique ones everywhere else.</li>
        <li><b>Turn on two-step sign-in</b> for email and banking first.</li>
        <li><b>Check your email address</b> on a breach-notification site to see what has already leaked.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="art-aff"><small>Some links on Local Buzz ATX may earn us a commission at no cost to you. We only mention tools we have used.</small></p>
    </div>
    <div class="art-share art-share2" data-share>
      <span class="art-sharek">Found this useful? Send it to someone</span>
      <button type="button" class="art-sbtn" data-native>Share…</button>
      <a href={share.sms}>Text</a><a href={share.wa} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a><a href={share.fb} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Facebook</a>
      <button type="button" class="art-sbtn" data-copy>Copy link</button>
    </div>
    <div class="art-author">
      <img class="art-av art-av-lg" src="/authors/caleb.jpg" alt="Illustration of Caleb" width="56" height="56" />
      <div><b>About Caleb</b><p>Caleb is the voice behind the explainers on Local Buzz ATX, connecting Austin news to money, tech and everyday life. Caleb is a pen name, and the picture is an illustration. <a href="/about">More about the site</a>.</p></div>
    </div>
    <AdRow />
    <div class="art-more">
      <div class="pagehead"><h2>More from Local Buzz</h2></div>
      <ul><li><a href="/news">Today's top Austin stories</a></li><li><a href="/money">What it means for your money</a></li><li><a href="/shout-out">Send a shout-out</a></li></ul>
    </div>
  </article>
  <script is:inline>
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-native]').forEach(function (b) {
      if (!navigator.share) { b.style.display = 'none'; return; }
      b.addEventListener('click', function () { navigator.share({ title: document.title, url: location.href }).catch(function () {}); });
    });
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-copy]').forEach(function (b) {
      b.addEventListener('click', function () {
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(location.href).then(function () { b.textContent = 'Copied'; setTimeout(function () { b.textContent = 'Copy link'; }, 1800); }).catch(function () {});
      });
    });
  </script>
</Layout>
